<title>CANADA: Laurentian Bank year Oct 31 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Laurentian Bank year Oct 31 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$2.23		   C$1.58</p>
<p> Net			 54,198		   35,656</p>
<p> Assets		12,472,213	     12,711,766</p>
<p> Deposits	    10,997,649	     11,252,004</p>
<p> Loans		 10,196,338		9,784,687</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Results for 1995 year include a pre-tax charge of C$7.6 million for costs relating to the integration of North American Trust.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
</text>
